      "content": "i get that, but it feels like the \"pro\" side gets described in terms of empowering and choice, while the \"con\" side is described in terms of anger and fear. isn't it more about the fact that the current system is just failing kids and vouchers are the only way to fix it? it seems like the opposition is just trying to protect a broken status quo.",
